#: data/maps/DewfordTown_House1/scripts.inc:22
msgctxt "DewfordTown_House1_Text_LotToBeSaidForLivingOnIsland"
msgid ""
"There's a lot to be said for living on\n"
"a small island like this in harmony with\l"
"POKéMON and the family.$"
msgstr ""
"在这样的小岛上，和宝可梦\n"
"还有家人和睦地生活在一起，\l"
"真的有很多好处。$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_House1/scripts.inc:27
msgctxt "DewfordTown_House1_Text_LifeGoesSlowlyOnIsland"
msgid ""
"I left the major port of SLATEPORT\n"
"CITY when I married my husband here.\p"
"Life goes by slowly on this little\n"
"island. But being surrounded by the\l"
"beautiful sea--that's happiness, too.$"
msgstr ""
"我嫁给我丈夫以后，\n"
"就离开了大港口凯那市，来到这里。\p"
"在这个小岛上，生活过得很悠闲。\n"
"不过被美丽的大海环绕着，\l"
"这也是一种幸福呢。$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_House1/scripts.inc:34
msgctxt "DewfordTown_House1_Text_Zigzagoon"
msgid "ZIGZAGOON: Guguuh!$"
msgstr "蛇纹熊：咕咕——！$"
